{"id":"n28413-1-8","stage":4,"title":"낱말 · 单词","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28413-1-8-1","ko":"이 문제는 왜 틀렸니?","zh":"这个问题为什么答错了呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제는","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"틀렸니?","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"틀리다：错，错误；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"틀리다","audio":"/audio/5bbafb331d40a891bb62.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71481","senseId":"1","lemma":"틀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"5bbafb331d40a891","term":"틀리다","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/5bbafb331d40a891bb62.mp3","entryId":"71481","definition":"计算或答案、事实等不正确。","pronunciation":["틀리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a9a139a68df936129574.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28413-1-8-2","ko":"이 낱말의 의미를 몰라서 문제를 못 풀었어요.","zh":"因为不知道这个单词的意思，所以才做不对题。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"낱말의","meaning":"单词，词语","explanation":"낱말：单词，词语；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"낱말","audio":"/audio/a5d73953f6572fd27382.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28413","senseId":"1","lemma":"낱말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의미를","meaning":"意义","explanation":"의미：意义；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"의미","audio":"/audio/adfc8cc897bfb433c0d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62385","senseId":"1","lemma":"의미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰라서","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제를","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풀었어요.","meaning":"解开，解答","explanation":"풀다：解开，解答；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"풀다","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29761","senseId":"5","lemma":"풀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a5d73953f6572fd2","term":"낱말","zh":"单词，词语","audio":"/audio/a5d73953f6572fd27382.mp3","entryId":"28413","definition":"具有一定的意义和功能、可单独被使用的最小的语言单位。","pronunciation":["난ː말"]},{"id":"adfc8cc897bfb433","term":"의미","zh":"意义","audio":"/audio/adfc8cc897bfb433c0d9.mp3","entryId":"62385","definition":"话语、文字或符号等表示的意思。","pronunciation":["의ː미"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"cada9014a11f228c","term":"풀다","zh":"解开，解答","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3","entryId":"29761","definition":"解决不懂、复杂的问题或找到其答案。","pronunciation":["풀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/703d7ad25d3db63e237d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.456,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28413","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.2827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为不知道这个单词的意思，所以才做不对题。","这个问题为什么答错了呢？","找到围巾了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个问题为什么答错了呢？","找到围巾了吗？","因为不知道这个单词的意思，所以才做不对题。"],"answer":2}]}
